[statement]
A `!` entry is judged once the package it names can no longer be installed
by anything still to be decided: `docs` is installed later, for `Q`, and
`e`, whose condition holds until then, is not installed.

[repository]
P:top
V:1
D:base Q

P:base
V:1

P:docs
V:1
p:Q=1

P:e
V:1
i:base !docs

[request]
top

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install base 1
install docs 1
install top 1
